      "text": "If I think about the things I gravitate toward\u2014clean architecture, interconnected graphs, late-night debugging sessions, and the feeling of launching something new (\"antigravity\")\u2014it looks a bit like a quiet night sky above a glowing terminal and a warm cup of coffee:\n\n```text\n          .       *             .         *           .\n    *          .        .   *         .          .        *\n         .         _..._          .        *        .\n       *         .:::::::.     .                .\n                :::::::::::          /\\               *\n        .       :::::::::::         /  \\     .\n                 `:::::::'         /____\\          .\n           *       `'''`           |    |      *\n     .                        .    | () |               .\n              _________________    |    |         *\n             |  _____________  |   |____|    .\n             | | >_          | |   /    \\          ( (\n             | |   o---o     | |  /      \\          ) )\n             | |   |  /      | | /________\\      ........\n             | |   o         | |    || ||        |      |]\n             | |_____________| |    || ||        \\      /\n             |_________________|    '' ''         `----'\n            /  ===============  \\\n           /_____________________\\\n```\n\nA little mix of:\n- **Graphs & Trees** (`o---o`) \u2014 untangling complex dependencies and architectures.\n- **Space & Flight** \u2014 defying gravity and exploring unknown territory.\n- **The Terminal & Coffee** \u2014 the classic companions of building things from scratch.",
